      "reason": "O2/O7 anchor the recognized-but-pending identity. C2-C5 reproduce seven new deliveries at 1,2,3,5,6,7,8 and the initial-bulk rival with duplicates at 1 and 5, leaving N8 outside the window. Six validations and six requests use R1-R7 without extra capacity. M1-M4 separate the two operational arms, and the output/action/bulk-membership defeat is explicit. U1-U3 remain unknown; no execution or global optimum is claimed.",
