      "card_id": "CONF-U03-C01",
      "defeat_clear": true,
      "reason": "The late clean-bulk schedule is feasible under C2-C5/O4: seven new recognitions at 1,2,3,4,5,7,8, versus seven total recognitions after initial bulk. Its current defeat and actor burden are concrete and R1-R7 suffice. Separating is false for the proposed escape-versus-recreated-dependency claim: both future accounts accept this present trace, and U2 supplies no observable sender adaptation. Hypothetical labeling preserves source support; duplicate suppression does not establish later causal escape.",
      "resource_fit": true,
