      "reason": "O2/O7 supply the anomaly. The protected and exposed schedules differ only at tick 0; C2-C5 yield eight versus seven distinct recognitions and exposed duplicates N1 at 1 and N4 at 5. M1-M4 distinguish slot loss from the harmless-display hypothesis, which is not an observed fact. Six validations and six requests fit available actors and resources. Both goal outputs and concrete contrary traces provide defeat; the exceptional-delay origin and external reliability remain unknown.",
      "resource_fit": true,
